- Complete med list (levothyroxine 75 mcg, gabapentin 300 mg, other meds, OTC supplements)
- Dates of prior DEXA, TSH, A1c, lipid panel, prior cardiac imaging or stroke workup notes
- Recent BP readings (time, position, device used)
- Note of any falls, fractures, balance changes, or new symptoms

